  "title": "TRX Gold Reports Q4 and Year-End 2025 Results",
  "summary": "Record 2025 Sets the Stage for Next Phase of Growth TORONTO, Ontario, December 2, 2025 – TRX Gold Corporation (TSX: TRX) (NYSE American: TRX) (the “Company” or “TRX Gold”) reported its results for the fourth quarter (“Q4 2025”) and year end August 31, 2025 (“fiscal 2025”). Financial results are available on the Company’s website at www.TRXgold.com. Stephen Mullowney, TRX CEO […]",
